    "turn_text": "I couldn't agree more. We need people like Joe who understands the community who's had an experience in many aspects of the real-life, public, who can go to Congress with enthusiasm and a commitment. He will be a person that will be playing all the instruments in the congressional orchestra. And we're a community that's got many challenges, economic, health care, energy, some special challenges in fields such as immigration. We need to have a congressman who under all of that could be effective.",
