    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 20,
    "turn_text": "Yes. And she I met with her. And there's very impressed. I didn't know her as I have both Joe and Raul over a number of years, but she's an extremely talented, articulate person. And again, I think would bring her broad experience in the community to Washington and would deliver for the people of South Florida.",
