    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 21,
    "turn_text": "I agree. And I've had the chance to meet all three of them, to interview them all on my show, and the more I speak with each of them, the more impressed I am, and the more hopeful I am that they can actually get elected this year.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_03",
