  {
    "episode_id": 91224,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "Well, I'm hopeful too. I think there are some things that are extremely sad that are occurring, such as the almost collapse of our financial and economic systems. But they are driving home to voters the fact that we paid a high price for the kind of government we've had for the last eight years and we don't have any time to waste in making fundamental change. These three good people running for Congress and Barack Obama and Joe Biden will be carrying the flag for that change.",
