    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 26,
    "turn_text": "Well, it was the move that the administration put forward. And I think sometimes in life, you've got to Select what you think is better than the status quo, even though it may not be exactly what you would like. So I would have voted for this. I would have demanded the kind of accountability and protection for taxpayers that generally got included in the final",
