        "text": "The outcome of the situation is uncertain but critical.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Hope is an appropriate response to uncertainty in high-stakes situations.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "There are no reliable alternatives to relying on hope at this point.",
        "confidence": 0.87
