      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that Barack Obama has the potential to act decisively under pressure.",
        "confidence": 0.78
      }
    ],
    "turn_type_label": "Substantive",
    "conversation_move_label": "Clarification Request (Specific)"
  },
  {
    "episode_id": 91224,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "That's another reason I would have voted for this less than perfect bill. It provides a beginning point for future change. If that's required and I suspect it will be required with a democratic majority in both the House and the Senate and Barack Obama's president will be in a position to take another look at what's required to deal with a financial and economic crisis of the debt that we are",
