        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The inclusion of experts like Buffett, Rubin, and Volker implies they are trusted and influential in policy decisions.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The American public values stability, confidence, and economic recovery above other concerns at present.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "Political unity between major parties is achievable and desirable in times of national crisis.",
