    "turn_text": "these very rich people would use that money wisely to invest and jobs would be created. Well, eight years later, I'd say that that little piece of economic theory has pretty much been shot full of holes. So Barack Obama has promised that he's going to get us back on a track of giving relief to the 95 percent of American taxpayers who go out and work every day and make this country work. And for those who are earning over a quarter of a million dollars a year, they're going to have to tighten their belt a little bit from what they've been given in the past. in order to pay for tax relief for those Americans who need it and who and when the money's in their hands they will stimulate growth that will benefit all of us.",
