    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/1/91224.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 66,
    "turn_text": "Nicole, this is something that I've been dreaming of for a long time. A place in Florida where we can both prepare young people who are effective and honor public and civic service and to study what it's going to take in order to achieve the goal of a new generation of stating Americans in their democracy. As we talk this afternoon, I'm driving to Gainesville where we're going to have a series of activities tomorrow culminating in a program on the path to the White House. What does it mean for Florida with two of our younger rising stars in the Florida congressional delegation?",
